## Problem classes

### `Root SKILL.md hides the pack`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `npx skills add` installs one skill or none | A `SKILL.md` at repo root stops the default walk | Keep skills only under `skills/<name>/`; no root SKILL.md |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Frontmatter name ≠ folder`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Agent cannot find `/grill-me` or install name mismatches | `name:` does not match parent directory, or `name:` lives only in the markdown body | `name:` must equal the folder. Pack-check reads it only from YAML between the first two `---` lines; missing `name:` fails. Do not count a body heading as the skill name. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Validator and fixtures must land together`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Existing pack-check tests fail as soon as a new rule ships | Fixtures still match the old weaker check | Update fixtures and assertions in the same change as the validator |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->
